                                jcr:lastModifiedBy="kaspatx"
                                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                text="&lt;p>&lt;span class=&quot;body-unica-20-reg&quot;>Thomas joined AbbVie in 2021 as Business Unit Director for Specialty Care. In the summer of 2024 he took responsibility for the Immunology department as Business Unit Director. He has a long track record in numerous global and affiliate roles, including leadership roles in global lifecycle and franchise management within marketing and sales. He holds a Master’s degree in economics.&lt;/span>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;span class=&quot;body-unica-20-reg&quot;>Before joining AbbVie, Thomas spent several years at a large international Swiss pharma company in Basel where he led the schizophrenia lifecycle team (development and commercial) and served as the Global Franchise Head Established Products. Prior to this position, he spent ten years in the USA in numerous commercial roles in global neuroscience and immunology, lastly as Global Brand Leader and Head of the Immunology franchise. Before moving to the USA, he held operational pharma affiliate roles in the Netherlands.&lt;/span>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;span class=&quot;body-unica-20-reg&quot;>Thomas holds a Master’s degree of science in economics and marketing from the Erasmus University Rotterdam, Netherlands.&lt;/span>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                                textIsRich="true"/>
                            <button
                                cq:styleIds="[1659997777274]"
                                jcr:created="{Date}2022-12-02T16:28:04.724-05:00"
                                jcr:createdBy="chiucx"
                                jcr:lastModified="{Date}2024-03-29T17:05:00.040-04:00"
                                jcr:lastModifiedBy="jewitca"
                                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                jcr:title="LinkedIn Profile"
                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/button/v2/button"
                                accessibilityLabel="LinkedIn profile"
                                linkTarget="_blank"
                                linkURL="https://www.linkedin.com/in/thomas-schrooyen-83181610/"/>
                        </par_14>
                        <text_copy
                            cq:styleIds="[1659545825678]"
                            jcr:created="{Date}2022-11-29T15:27:16.203-05:00"
                            jcr:createdBy="chiucx"
                            jcr:lastModified="{Date}2024-03-15T14:02:54.273-04:00"
                            jcr:lastModifiedBy="jewitca"
                            jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                            sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                            text="&lt;p>&lt;span class=&quot;body-unica-20-reg&quot;>Linn kam 2017 als General Manager Schweden zu AbbVie und übernahm 2019&amp;nbsp;ausserdem die Leitung der neu geschaffenen skandinavischen Tochtergesellschaft (Dänemark, Norwegen und Schweden). Zuvor war Linn vier Jahre lang als Country Managerin für ein internationales Pharmaunternehmen in Schweden tätig, nachdem sie 17&amp;nbsp;Jahre lang Berufserfahrung in verschiedenen kaufmännischen Funktionen in unterschiedlichen Therapiebereichen und mit Verantwortung für den gesamten nordischen Raum sammeln konnte.&lt;/span>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;span class=&quot;body-unica-20-reg&quot;>Linn hat 1995 einen Master of Science in Pharmazie an der Universität Uppsala erworben.&lt;/span>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                            textIsRich="true"/>
